 ion\, and presentation skills. Through guided practice\, peer feedback\, a
 nd interactive activities\, participants improve their ability to express 
 ideas clearly\, engage in conversations\, and deliver presentations in a w
 elcoming and encouraging setting.\nTogether\, we will:\n1. Have a short\, 
 collective discussion period.\n2. Begin writing based on a prompt from th
 e instructor\n(Example: E-mail\, formal letter\, poetry\, free-write)\n3. 
